    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        GamerAstra: Supporting 2D Non-Twitch Video Games for Blind and Low-Vision Players through a Multi-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> Framework
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Qiu%2C+T">Tianrun Qiu</a>, 
      
